<view class="mist"/><t-navbar placeholder="{{true}}" id="app-header" title="联系手机号" left-arrow delta="{{0}}" bind:go-back="goBack"/>
<view class="screen contact-page"><view class="page-heading">修改联系手机号</view><view class="support gap">号码填错了，可以在这里更正。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取当前号码…</view>
  <block wx:if="{{ready}}"><view class="contact-card glass"><view class="support">当前号码</view><view class="contact-number" user-select>{{original || '尚未填写'}}</view></view><view class="phone-edit-field"><t-input label="手机号" type="number" value="{{phone}}" maxlength="11" clearable borderless disabled="{{busy || needsCheck}}" bind:change="input" class="input-phone"/></view><view class="edit-explanation"><t-icon name="info-circle" size="15px"/><text>此号码用于账号展示、房东联系和核对。修改后不会改变你的微信身份或租住关系，租住档案中的号码请联系房东更正。</text></view><t-button wx:if="{{!needsCheck}}" theme="primary" size="large" block bind:tap="save" disabled="{{busy || loading}}" loading="{{busy}}" class="action-save">保存手机号</t-button></block>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="login-error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="saved-hint"><t-icon name="check-circle-filled" size="18px"/>{{message}}</view><t-button wx:if="{{needsCheck || !ready && !loading}}" theme="primary" size="large" block bind:tap="refresh" disabled="{{busy}}" class="action-refresh">{{needsCheck ? '读取当前号码，核对保存结果' : '重新读取'}}</t-button>
</view>
